ilestone":{"title":"Shape unlocked!","body":"Folded! Next: two different protein-finishing examples.","badge":"Folding friend"}},{"id":"cleave","kind":"cleave","group":"Finish","title":"Insulin example: cut to finish","instruction":"Cut proinsulin into insulin.","payload":"protein:cleavage","target":"protein:cleave","options":[{"label":"Cleavage enzymes","payload":"protein:cleavage","detail":"Cut a precursor into a product","symbol":"scissors","asset":null},{"label":"Chaperone","payload":"protein:chaperone","detail":"Help this full chain fold","symbol":"hands.sparkles.fill","asset":null}],"learn":["Some proteins are cut into functional pieces. Proinsulin is cleaved to produce 51-amino-acid insulin.","Cleavage and assembly are different finishing examples. Different proteins use different finishing steps."],"points":30,"hint":"Some proteins are cut into functional pieces. Proinsulin is cleaved to produce 51-amino-acid insulin.","wrong":"Try another tool or the glowing target.","success":"Insulin ready!","autoPayload":null,"sequenceIndex":null,"codonIndex":null,"uniqueGroup":null,"milestone":null},{"id":"assemble-0","kind":"assemble","group":"Finish","title":"Hemoglobin example: team up","instruction":"Fit four chains together.","payload":"*","target":"hemoglobin:*","options":[{"label":"Subunit 1","payload":"subunit:0","detail":"Separate polypeptide chain","symbol":"circle.hexagongrid.fill","asset":null},{"label":"Subunit 2","payload":"subunit:1","detail":"Separate polypeptide chain","symbol":"circle.hexagongrid.fill","asset":null},{"label":"Subunit 3","payload":"subunit:2","detail":"Separate polypeptide chain","symbol":"circle.hexagongrid.fill","asset":null},{"label":"Subunit 4","payload":"subunit:3","detail":"Separate polypeptide chain","symbol":"circle.hexagongrid.fill","asset":null}],"learn":["Some proteins assemble from multiple polypeptide chains. Hemoglobin combines four separate subunits.","Each game piece is one separate chain; colors do not name different su